    "title": "Ffuuu - Rage Comic Maker",
    "description": "Ffuuu Rage Comic Maker it's a Rage Comic creator based in a Material Design interface with a modern, fast and easy to use design. It allows you to create and share Rage Comics in the Internet.\r\n\r\nIt features one finger interaction with added images and text, importing images from gallery and drawing tools like pen, line, arrow, rectangle, circle, ellipse and eraser.\r\nIt can save your work for continuing later and export to high quality JPEG image archive\r\n\r\nCredits: https://ffuuu.mobi/credits.php",
